  <!-- EN: Antimatter Reactor -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_Antimatter_Battleship.label>反物质反应堆</GR_MechModule_Reactor_Antimatter_Battleship.label>
  <!-- EN: Harnesses the immense energy released by matter-antimatter annihilation. Its power density far exceeds conventional fusion reactors and can reliably drive heavier combat configurations. -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_Antimatter_Battleship.description>利用正反物质湮灭释放的巨量能量，其单位体积供能效率已远超常规聚变堆，可稳定驱动更重型的战斗配置。</GR_MechModule_Reactor_Antimatter_Battleship.description>
  
