  <!-- EN: Cold Fusion Reactor -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_ColdFusion_Battleship.label>冷聚变反应堆</GR_MechModule_Reactor_ColdFusion_Battleship.label>
  <!-- EN: Maintains fusion at relatively low temperatures, making a new generation of efficient reactors possible and allowing the chassis to support high-load combat modules with ease. -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_ColdFusion_Battleship.description>在相对低温环境下维持聚变反应，使新一代高效反应堆成为现实，也让机体能更从容地支撑高负载作战模块。</GR_MechModule_Reactor_ColdFusion_Battleship.description>
  
