  <!-- EN: Dark Matter Reactor -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_DarkMatter_Battleship.label>暗物质反应堆</GR_MechModule_Reactor_DarkMatter_Battleship.label>
  <!-- EN: These power cores seem to draw energy directly from dark matter. Their actual output exceeds anything conventional physical models can explain. -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_DarkMatter_Battleship.description>这些动力核心仿佛能直接从暗物质中抽取能量，实际输出已经超出常规物理模型所能解释的范畴。</GR_MechModule_Reactor_DarkMatter_Battleship.description>
  
