  <!-- EN: Fission Reactor -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_Fission_Battleship.label>裂变反应堆</GR_MechModule_Reactor_Fission_Battleship.label>
  <!-- EN: Provides basic power to mechanoids through controlled nuclear fission, but also brings constant waste heat and nuclear waste disposal pressure. -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_Fission_Battleship.description>通过受控核裂变为机械体提供基础能源，但同时也会带来持续的废热与核废料处理压力。</GR_MechModule_Reactor_Fission_Battleship.description>
  
