  <!-- EN: Fusion Reactor -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_Fusion_Battleship.label>聚变反应堆</GR_MechModule_Reactor_Fusion_Battleship.label>
  <!-- EN: Nuclear fusion delivers higher output more stably. It significantly raises the power ceiling while avoiding most inherent risks of fission systems. -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_Fusion_Battleship.description>核聚变能够以更稳定的方式输出更高功率，在显著抬升供能上限的同时，规避大部分裂变系统的固有风险。</GR_MechModule_Reactor_Fusion_Battleship.description>
  
