  <!-- EN: Zero-Point Reactor -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_ZeroPoint_Battleship.label>零点反应堆</GR_MechModule_Reactor_ZeroPoint_Battleship.label>
  <!-- EN: Draws zero-point energy directly from vacuum fluctuations, compressing an almost inexhaustible power reserve into a standardized shipboard power core. -->
  <GR_MechModule_Reactor_ZeroPoint_Battleship.description>直接从真空涨落中抽取零点能，近乎无穷的供能储备开始被压缩进标准化舰载动力核心之中。</GR_MechModule_Reactor_ZeroPoint_Battleship.description>
  
